<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="http-checkfile-string">
  <title>Check that a file exists</title>
  <body>
    <p>Write the release notes to the <codeph>output</codeph> folder next to this page:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-shell">node -e "const fs=require('fs');fs.mkdirSync('output',{recursive:true});fs.writeFileSync('output/notes.txt','release notes')"</codeblock>
    <p>Check that <codeph>output/notes.txt</codeph> exists.</p>
  </body>
</topic>
